# Walkthrough - Backend Setup and Authentication

## Changes Implemented
### Backend Initialization
- Created Django project `config` and `users` app.
- Configured [settings.py](file:///d:/final%20year%20project/V/backend/config/settings.py) for PostgreSQL, REST Framework, and CORS.
- Set up environment variables in [.env](file:///d:/final%20year%20project/V/backend/.env).

### Database Integration
- Connected to PostgreSQL database `vaathi`.
- Implemented [CustomUser](file:///d:/final%20year%20project/V/backend/users/models.py#4-26) model inheriting from `AbstractUser`.
- Successfully ran migrations to create user tables.

### User Authentication
- Implemented [RegisterView](file:///d:/final%20year%20project/V/backend/users/views.py#7-10) (POST) and [LoginView](file:///d:/final%20year%20project/V/backend/users/views.py#11-22) (POST).
- Configured URL routing at `/api/register/` and `/api/login/`.

